  "body": "From IRC:\n\n> 3:45 PM <nox> https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#labeled-control 'If the attribute is specified, the attribute's value must be the ID of a labelable element in the same Document as the label element.' Is that true regardless whether the label is in the tree or not?\n> 5:27 PM <nox> \"in the same Document\" should probably refer to https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#in-a-document in some way so that no one has to wonder about that ever again.\n\n/cc @nox\n",
